<title>UK: Salomon sets 150 million stg five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets 150 million stg five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SALOMON INC</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *26.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     50 BP     PAY DATE    26.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA1	ISS PRICE  =	   FULL FEES   0.30 PCT</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB	 REOFFER    99.584</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AT PAR FROM YEAR THREE</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
